mediumColumns 1

logo.png

Aloha.

I'm Breck and my goals with Flash are to help entrepreneurs:

- become best craftspeople they can be
- build greatest products and teams they can create
- advance and preserve humanity, science and public domain
- while preserving as much of their time as possible for walks in the woods

Those are my goals.

I will do many things along those lines.

I'm just getting started.

*Let's build together.*

Start by reaching out: [breck7@gmail.com, @breckyunits, 808-368-2541] a photo of what you are building.

* - Breck

***

# Update: Now also taking LPs!

Unless I'm not allowed to say that publicly, in which case for your own safety please take your money and ask local SEC representative for directions to your nearest casino.

